"STORES  – MESSYWEEKEND (https://messyweekend.dk/pages/stores)\nciteturn356search0 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 4 weeks ago; Content type: text/plain; \nSTORES – MESSYWEEKEND Flagship Stores Step inside the MESSYWEEKEND universe, where our passion for sunglasses meets a considered approach to materials, textures, and layout—creating cohesive, inviting spaces that reflect our identity. Our stores follow the same principles as our products: clarity, control, and purpose. A modular aluminium framework and custom furniture in honest materials create clean, functional environments designed for exploration. Ho Chi Minh City (VN) Takashimaya Department Storeu2028 2nd Floor, Saigon Centre (Takashimaya) 92–94 Nam Ky Khoi Nghia St., Ben Nghe Ward, District 1, Ho Chi Minh City Monday to Thursday: 9:30 – 21:30u2028 Friday to Saturday: 9:30 – 22:00u2028 Public Holidays: 9:30 – 22:00 HO CHI MINH CITY (VN) Vincom Center Dong Khoiu2028 72 Le Thanh Ton St., District 1, Ho Chi Minh City 700000, Vietnamu2028 Monday to Friday: 10:00 – 22:00 Saturday to Sunday: 9:30 – 22:00 HANOI (VN) Hà Nội Centeru2028 175 Nguyen Thai Hoc St., O Cho Dua Ward, Hanoi, Vietnam TBILISI (GE) Tbilisi Mallu2028 16 km Davit Aghmashenebeli Ave, Tbilisi 0131, Georgiau2028 Monday to Sunday: 10:00 – 22:00u2028 Public Holidays: 10:00 – 22:00 SHOP ONLINE Premium collection Our Premium Collection represents the highest level of craftsmanship and design, crafted from high-grade acetate with refined details, exclusive shapes, and a luxurious finish. Designed for those who want standout style with a premium feel. 700 DKK / 100 € Core collection The Core Collection is built on high-quality acetate with classic, versatile shapes designed for everyday wear. A perfect balance of style, comfort, and reliability. 600 DKK / 85 € Essential collection The Essential Collection features lightweight and flexible TR90 frames with modern, simple designs. Built for effortless everyday wear and all-day comfort. 400 DKK / 55 € AKI - Black